                                                                                                                                                                                                                     [1mPhone view.[22m Press Ctrl+Shift+M in DevTools to switch on the device toolbar and pick a phone. Test on a phone first, then turn it off and test desktop.                                                                                                                                                                                                                  The dev server uses the [1mreal timetable at the current Lisbon time[22m. If Metrobus isn't running when you test (late at night), stops still select, but no buses or countdowns appear.                                                                                                                                                                                    [1m[21;3H3. What to check[22m
                                                                                                                                                                                      1. [1mTap a far stop.[22m For[1Cexample,[1Ctap[1m[1CParque[22m,[1Cthe[1Cwhite[1Ccircle[1Csouth-west[1Cof[1CPortagem.[24;6H-[1CThe[1Csheet[1Cshows[38;2;177;185;249m[1C// SELECTED STOP[m,[1Cthe[1Cname[38;2;177;185;249m[1CParque[m[1Cand[1C"…[1Caway".[25;3H   - The map animates[1Cto[1CParque[1Cand[1Cthe[1Csoonest[1Capproaching[1Cbus[1Cin[1Ceach[1Cdirection.[1CYour[1Cown[1Cdot[1Cis[1Cnot[1Cpart[1Cof[1Cthat[1Cframing.[26;6H-[1CThe[1Cred[1Cstop[1Cmarker[1Cmoves[1Cto[1CParque.
 [1C   - Buses[1Ch[1Cading to[1CParque get countdown tags, and[1Cevery[1Cother[1Cbus[1Cis[1Cdimmed.[28;3H2.[1m[1CTap it again after panning.[22m[1CIt[1Cre-frames[1Con[1Cthe[1Cselected[1Cstop.[29;3H3. [1mTap empty map.[22m The[1Csheet[1Cgoes[1Cback[1Cto[38;2;177;185;249m[1C// NEAREST STOP[m[1C(Portagem)[1Cand[1Cthe[1Cmap[1Cgoes[1Cback[1Cto[1Cthe[1Cdefault[1Cframing:[1Cyou,[1CPortagem[1Cand[1Cthe[1Csoonest[1Cbus[1Ceach[1Cway.[30;3H4.[1m[1CTap empty map with nothing selected.[22m[1CNothing[1Chappens:[1Cthe[1Csheet[1Cand[1Cthe[1Ccamera[1Cstay[1Cas[1Cthey[1Care.
 [1C5. [1mDrag or pan the map.[22m Panni[1Cg [1Cever selects or deselects a stop.[K[32;3H6.[1m[1CTap your nearest stop (Portagem) while another stop is selected.[22m[1CThe[1Csheet[1Cshows[38;2;177;185;249m[1C// NEAREST STOP[m,[1Cnot[1C"Selected[1Cstop".[33;3H7. [1mLocate button.[22m Select[1Ca[1Cstop,[1Cthen[1Cpress[1C"Centre[1Con[1Cmy[1Clocation".[1CThe[1Capp[1Cgoes[1Cback[1Cto[1Cthe[1Cnearest[1Cstop[1Cand[1Cthe[1Cdefault[1Cframing.[34;3H8.[1m[1CDirection reset.[22m[1CSelect[1Ca[1Cstop[1Cthat[1Cis[1Cserved[1Cboth[1Cways,[1Csuch[1Cas[1CPortagem,[1Ccycle[1Cthe[1Cdirection[1Cbutton[1Cto[1Cone[1Cdirection,[1Cthen[1Cselect[1Canother[1Cstop.[1CThe[1Cdirection[1Cgoes[1Cback[1Cto
 [1C   "Both directions".[1C[K[36;3H9. [1mLocation off.[22m In the site settings (the lock[1Cicon[1C→[1CLocation[1C→[1CBlock),[1Cblock[1Clocation[1Cand[1Creload.[1CThe[1Csheet[1Csays[1Clocation[1Cis[1Coff.[37;6H-[1CTap[1CParque:[1Cits[1Cbuses[1Cand[1Ccountdowns[1Cappear,[1Cand[1Cthere[1Cis[1Cno[1C"away"[1Cdistance.
 [1C   - Tap empty[1Cmap:[1C"Locatio[1C is o[1Cf" comes b[1Cck, and[1Cthe[1Ccamera[1Cdoesn't[1Cmove.
  10. [1mDesktop only.[22m The mouse cursor becomes a pointer over a stop circle and goes back to normal over empty map.                                                                   [40;6H                                                                                                                                                                               [1m[41;3HAccepted limitations[22m (out of scope for this play): double-clicking[1Cempty[1Cmap[1Cto[1Czoom[1Calso[1Ccounts[1Cas[1Ctapping[1Caway[1Cwhen[1Ca[1Cstop[1Cis[1Cselected,[1Cand[1Cstops[1Ccan't[1Cbe[1Cselected[1Cwith[1Cthe[42;3Hkeyboard.[K[47;3H[?25h[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[38;2;215;119;87m[44;1H✻[38;2;218;124;92m[1CBefuddling…[47;3H[?25h[m[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[38;2;215;119;87m[44;1H✶[1CBefuddling…[47;3H[?25h[m]0;✳ Play 009 select-stop wrap-up[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[38;2;153;153;153m[44;1H✻[1CCogitated for 2m 24s[1C· done 12:10[K[m[47;1H❯ [?25h[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[2mstart the dev server[47;3H[?25h[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[22m[38;2;153;153;153m[45;159HChecking for updates[47;3H[?25h[m[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[45;159H[K[47;3H[?25h[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[38;2;153;153;153m[45;159HChecking for updates[47;3H[?25h[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[m[45;159H[K[47;3H[?25h[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[38;2;153;153;153m[45;159HChecking for updates[47;3H[?25h[?2026h[?2026l[?25l[m[45;159H[K[47;3H[?25h[?25l[H  - the [38;2;177;185;249mselecting a stop [mgroup                                                                                                                                                        - [38;2;177;185;249mlocation denied › selecting › selects a stop without a location                                                                                                                 [m  - [38;2;177;185;249mdesktop: the cursor points over a stop                                                                                                                                          [m                                                                                                                                                                                      To see a report of the results, run [38;2;177;185;249mnpx playwright show-report[m.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [1m2. Run the app by hand[22m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  [36mcd [mC:\Users\haraujo\.building\data\projects\[32m003[34m-metro[m\worktrees\[32m009[m\metro                                                                                                           npm run dev                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             Open [94m]8;id=u-urcxox%17373124008541427091;http://localhost:5173\[1mhttp://localhost:5173[m]8;;\ (or whichever URL Vite prints) in Chrome.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [1mFake your location.[22m Open DevTools (F12), then ⋮ → More tools → [1mSensors[22m → Location → Other…, and enter latitude [38;2;177;185;249m40.2057[m, longitude [38;2;177;185;249m-8.4307[m. That is about 200 m south of Portagem,   which is then your nearest stop. Reload and allow location.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             [1mPhone view.[22m Press Ctrl+Shift+M in DevTools to switch on the device toolbar and pick a phone. Test on a phone first, then turn it off and test desktop.                                                                                                                                                                                                                  The dev server uses the [1mreal timetable at the current Lisbon time[22m. If Metrobus isn't running when you test (late at night), stops still select, but no buses or countdowns appear.                                                                                                                                                                                      [1m3. What to check[22m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        1. [1mTap a far stop.[22m For example, tap [1mParque[22m, the white circle south-west of Portagem.                                                                                                   - The sheet shows [38;2;177;185;249m// SELECTED STOP[m, the name [38;2;177;185;249mParque [mand "… away".                                                                                                                   - The map animates to Parque and the soonest approaching bus in each direction. Your own dot is not part of that framing.                                                           - The red stop marker moves to Parque.                                                                                                                                              - Buses heading to Parque get countdown tags, and every other bus is dimmed.                                                                                                     2. [1mTap it again after panning.[22m It re-frames on the selected stop.                                                                                                                   3. [1mTap empty map.[22m The sheet goes back to [38;2;177;185;249m// NEAREST STOP [m(Portagem) and the map goes back to the default framing: you, Portagem and the soonest bus each way.                       4. [1mTap empty map with nothing selected.[22m Nothing happens: the sheet and the camera stay as they are.                                                                                 5. [1mDrag or pan the map.[22m Panning never selects or deselects a stop.[K
  6. [1mTap your nearest stop (Portagem) while another stop is selected.[22m The sheet shows [38;2;177;185;249m// NEAREST STOP[m, not "Selected stop".[K
  7. [1mLocate button.[22m Select a stop, then press "Centre on my location". The app goes back to the nearest stop and the default framing.[K
  8. [1mDirection reset.[22m Select a stop that is served both ways, such as Portagem, cycle the direction button to one direction, then select another stop. The direction goes back to   
     "Both directions".[K
  9. [1mLocation off.[22m In the site settings (the lock icon → Location → Block), block location and reload. The sheet says location is off.[K
     - Tap Parque: its buses and countdowns appear, and there is no "away" distance.[K
     - Tap empty map: "Location is off" comes back, and the camera doesn't move.[K
  10. [1mDesktop only.[22m The mouse cursor becomes a pointer over a stop circle and goes back to normal over empty map.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [1mAccepted limitations[22m (out of scope for this play): double-clicking empty map to zoom also counts as tapping away when a stop is selected, and stops can't be selected with the    
  keyboard.[K
